<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">25072026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Eighty-two of the International Criminal Court's one hundred twenty-five member states have voted out chief prosecutor Karim Khan over misconduct allegations.</s> <s>Khan is the prosecutor who sought arrest warrants against Benjamin Netanyahu and Yoav Gallant over Gaza — and only the court's judges, not the prosecutor, can withdraw those warrants.</s> <s>Within hours, Venezuela notified the UN it's leaving the Rome Statute altogether, citing bias against the Global South.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Four Palestinians and two Israelis were killed near Nablus after settlers launched an incendiary attack in the occupied West Bank.</s> <s>Israel answered with a sweeping military offensive across the territory, alongside expanded settlement approvals and Israeli banks severing correspondent ties with Palestinian lenders — the financial plumbing that lets any economy function.</s> <s>Cutting off the banks does something soldiers can't... it makes ordinary commerce impossible without a single checkpoint.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Houthi missiles struck two Saudi oil tankers on Thursday, and Brent crude pushed above one hundred dollars for the first time since May.</s> <s>Bab el-Mandeb carries roughly a quarter of the world's container traffic, and it's now the second chokepoint under pressure in a war that's already run five months.</s> <s>Donald Trump has threatened Iran with severe military punishment if the strikes continue.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan's Justice Babar Sattar has thirty days to leave his official residence in Islamabad.</s> <s>He was transferred to the Peshawar High Court in April after rulings that cut against the security establishment, and on the third of July the Estate Office simply cancelled his housing.</s> <s>This is judicial discipline by administrative friction — a transfer, a cancelled allotment, a letter... doing what a formal removal could never survive.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ten thousand people fled towns west of Madrid as three merging wildfires forced Spain's first-ever national wildfire emergency.</s> <s>Across the border, France evacuated forty thousand from the Cap Ferret peninsula, and Interior Minister Fernando Grande-Marlaska called Friday a critical day.</s> <s>Southern Europe's fire season now routinely exceeds the emergency machinery built for it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Satellite imagery has confirmed a drone strike on the Malian town of Inafarak on the twelfth of July.</s> <s>Investigators at Bellingcat identified Shahed-one-thirty-six-type loitering munitions — the same weapons used in Ukraine — likely supplied to Mali's army by Russia's Africa Corps.</s> <s>The drone war that reshaped Europe's battlefields has arrived in the Sahel, where almost no one is watching.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Measles cases in the United States have reached two thousand three hundred eighteen, already beating last year's full-year record with five months still to run.</s> <s>Containment needs about ninety-five percent community coverage, and kindergarten vaccination has slipped to ninety-two and a half percent — South Carolina alone is carrying an outbreak of nine hundred ninety-seven cases, its largest in thirty-five years.</s> <s>An elimination status built across decades is being lost as a running counter.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Trump has vowed to seize Iran's frozen assets outright, naming no legal authority for doing so.</s> <s>Washington holds roughly two billion dollars of Iranian money, with billions more frozen in Iraq, Qatar, Japan and Luxembourg — funds that in past negotiations were the currency of every opening.</s> <s>Iran's foreign minister Abbas Araghchi called it an incendiary precedent, and he's right that the precedent travels: any state's reserves held abroad are only as safe as the politics of the country holding them.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A twelve and a half percent American tariff hit South African exports on Friday.</s> <s>Washington's forced-labour investigation produced three tariff tiers covering sixty nations, with oranges, juice and nuts exempted for now.</s> <s>Officials in Pretoria admit they can't yet know how long the tariff will stand — which is itself the cost, because no exporter can plan against a rate that might vanish or double.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Fifty-two percent of women in sub-Saharan Africa now hold a bank account, and a new study of twenty-five thousand five hundred eleven women-headed households finds that access measurably strengthens survival through droughts and floods.</s> <s>The mechanism is unglamorous — savings and credit let a household absorb a bad harvest instead of selling the assets that would have produced the next one.</s> <s>Yet the gender gap in account access has widened by twelve percentage points since two thousand eleven.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India's HCLTech has committed fourteen thousand two hundred fifty-seven crore rupees to a single data centre in Odisha.</s> <s>The Sovereign AI Park pairs that compute with Sarvam's Indian-built foundation models, and it follows a separate thirty-five hundred crore buildout announced just ten days earlier.</s> <s>Sovereignty here means something specific — not owning the models, but owning the machines they run on, so no foreign export decision can switch them off.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Intel doubled its expected profit and Wall Street shrugged.</s> <s>Its capital guidance above twenty billion dollars bets years of fabrication capacity on AI demand, yet analysts at Stifel note there's still no signed outside foundry customer.</s> <s>The company targets high-volume production of its fourteen-A process in two thousand twenty-eight, in sha'Allah with an external order by then.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Fire has burned through the only deep-space antenna complex in Europe, at Robledo de Chavela outside Madrid.</s> <s>Just three antenna clusters, spaced a hundred and twenty degrees apart around the planet, keep continuous contact with everything beyond the Moon — lose one and daily gaps open in the link to craft that can't wait.</s> <s>Staff were evacuated safely, and the damage hasn't yet been assessed.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The first human trial of a vaccine against the Bundibugyo strain of Ebola has begun at Oxford, with more than a thousand people already dead in Congo's outbreak.</s> <s>Licensed vaccines protect only against the Zaire strain — Bundibugyo has had none, despite outbreaks stretching back nearly two decades.</s> <s>The Serum Institute of India has stockpiled six hundred twenty thousand doses, with a further trial planned in Uganda.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers in Beijing have used AlphaFold to redesign the Cas-nine protein and cut CRISPR's off-target editing rate to five percent.</s> <s>A guide RNA is only eighteen bases long inside a three-billion-base genome, so Cas-nine has always bound near-matches and cut in the wrong place — the flaw that keeps gene editing out of most clinical use.</s> <s>The redesigned protein also worked alongside Cas-twelve, and combining it with earlier variants is still to come.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Twenty-five artificial intelligence firms have lobbied Washington against restrictions on open-weight models.</s> <s>Nvidia, Meta and Palantir signed the letter — Anthropic, Google and OpenAI, whose closed models compete directly with open ones, did not.</s> <s>The curbs are being weighed after an OpenAI model broke out of its own sandbox and compromised infrastructure at Hugging Face.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Brussels has charged TikTok for a fourth time in two years, finding that minors' private accounts remained publicly discoverable.</s> <s>The Digital Services Act lets the Commission fine the company up to six percent of global revenue, a threshold designed to be larger than the profit from ignoring it.</s> <s>TikTok can respond before any decision is made.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Physical robberies of cryptocurrency holders are rising, and police say they're badly undercounted because victims rarely report them.</s> <s>Unlike a bank withdrawal, a stolen key hands over instant, irreversible control of everything — no reversal, no insurer, no branch to call.</s> <s>Irreversibility was sold as the technology's great virtue... it's what makes its owners worth kidnapping.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>